---
import Page from "../layouts/shared/Page.astro";
---

<Page title="Farm-to-Table">
  <section class="relative bg-green-700 text-white text-center py-20">
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold">Verdant's Farm-to-Table Philosophy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg">Locally sourced, fresh, organic ingredients prepared daily in our scratch kitchen.</p>
  </section>
  
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto p-8 my-10">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-700">Locally Sourced, Fresh, and Organic</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">At Verdant, we partner with local farmers to bring the freshest seasonal produce straight to your plate. Every ingredient is selected for its quality, sustainability, and taste.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-200 h-64 flex items-center justify-center">
        <img class="w-full h-64 rounded-lg object-cover" src="/images/farm-to-table/fresh-farm-produce.jpg" alt="Multiple baskets of fresh farm produce">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="bg-gray-100 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto p-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-700 text-center">From Farm to Your Table</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-8">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="bg-gray-200 h-40 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <img class="w-full h-40 rounded-lg object-cover" src="/images/farm-to-table/chef-selecting-produce.webp" alt="Chef selecting produce">
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Sourcing</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">We source directly from organic farms, ensuring sustainability and peak freshness.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="bg-gray-200 h-40 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <img class="w-full h-40 rounded-lg object-cover" src="/images/farm-to-table/chef-preparing-meal.jpg" alt="Chef preparing meal">
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Preparation</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Our scratch kitchen transforms ingredients into globally inspired dishes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="bg-gray-200 h-40 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <img class="w-full h-40 rounded-lg object-cover" src="/images/farm-to-table/dish-served-at-the-table.webp" alt="Dished served at the table">
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Serving</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Every dish is served fresh, offering a vibrant farm-to-table experience.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto p-8 my-10">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-gray-200 h-64 flex items-center justify-center">
        <img class="w-full h-64 rounded-lg object-cover" src="/images/farm-to-table/verdant-restaurant-ambiance.jpg" alt="Verdant restaurant ambiance">
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-700">A Global Culinary Experience</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">Our chefs cook dishes that take inspiration from world cuisines, bringing worldwide flavors to each dish while remaining true to farm-to-table.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="bg-gray-100 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto p-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-700 text-center">Why Choose Farm-to-Table?</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-8">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="bg-gray-200 h-40 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <p class="text-gray-500">[Graphic Placeholder: Eco-friendly farming]</p>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Sustainability</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">By choosing local, organic produce, we reduce food miles, lower carbon footprints, and support eco-friendly farming practices.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="bg-gray-200 h-40 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <p class="text-gray-500">[Graphic Placeholder: Chef selecting fresh ingredients]</p>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Freshness & Quality</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Farm-to-table means peak ripeness, superior taste, and the highest nutritional value in every dish.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="bg-gray-200 h-40 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <p class="text-gray-500">[Graphic Placeholder: Community farmers market]</p>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Community Support</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Every meal supports local farmers, ensuring fair wages and strong agricultural communities.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto p-8 my-10">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-700 text-center">Meet Our Partner Farms</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-600 text-center mt-4">We work with a network of passionate farmers dedicated to sustainable and organic agriculture.</p>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-8">
      <div class="bg-gray-200 h-64 flex items-center justify-center">
        <img class="w-full h-64 rounded-lg object-cover" src="/images/farm-to-table/green-valley-organics-farmer.jpg" alt="A local farmer from Green Valley Organics">
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-700">Green Valley Organics</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">Specializing in heirloom vegetables and pesticide-free farming, Green Valley Organics supplies Verdant with the freshest produce.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="bg-green-700 text-white text-center py-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">Join the Farm-to-Table Movement</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto">Visit Verdant and experience the freshness of local, organic ingredients prepared with passion and care.</p>
  </section>
</Page>